129:Ta6f,Waldems, July 2024 – plastship GmbH is pleased to announce its participation in [FACHPACK 2024](https://www.fachpack.de/en), taking place from September 24 to 26 at the Nuremberg Exhibition Centre. As Europe's leading trade fair for packaging, technology, and processes, FACHPACK provides a unique platform to discover groundbreaking innovations and network with industry professionals.

## Material procurement – manage material flows, ensure quality.

plastship will be present at **Hall 5, Booth 220**, together with its parent company [RIGK GmbH](/partners/). The RIGK and plastship team looks forward to showcasing comprehensive services aimed at promoting the circular economy and providing sustainable solutions for the packaging industry.

Overview of plastship services:

- [Procurement and distribution](/procurement/)
- [Factory disposal](/waste-disposal/)
- [Recycling plastics database](/material-search/)
- [Design for Recycling](/design-for-recycling/)

In addition to RIGK's legally compliant packaging take-back and recycling, backed by over 30 years of licensing experience, the companies offer certifications through RIGK's PlastCert division according to RecyClass, as well as material testing and analysis for packaging. This helps companies save potential plastic taxes and sustainably close the loop of their packaging. This offering and the plastship platform promote the use of recyclates and secondary raw materials by providing high-quality recycled plastics or secondary raw materials tailored to the specific requirements of companies and their packaging.

**Your contacts at FACHPACK:**

To optimize your visit, find your individual contacts [here](https://www.rigk.de/en/ifat-2024-1), who will welcome you at FACHPACK. Send us an email with your preferred appointment time and mark it in your Outlook calendar! We are also happy to send you a free admission voucher.

plastship Managing Director Andreas Bastian on the opportunities at the fair: *"FACHPACK is the perfect opportunity for us to present our innovative solutions for a sustainable circular economy at the source, the packaging industry. Through our services and platform, we aim to help companies make their packaging more efficient and environmentally friendly. We look forward to exchanging ideas and shaping the future of the packaging industry together with you."*

We look forward to your visit and to shaping the future of the circular economy together!

If you have questions or suggestions, please contact me!

**Andreas Bastian**, Founder and Managing Director\
